cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If Nullius contributed to your work, please cite it using the metadata below. Each GitHub release is archived on Zenodo; prefer the DOI of the exact version you used."
type: software
title: "Nullius: an evidence-first harness for agent-assisted research"
authors:
  - family-names: Guo
    given-names: Feng-Kun
version: 0.6.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/fkguo/nullius"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - research harness
  - agent-assisted research
  - reproducibility
  - verification
  - scientific computing
abstract: >-
  Nullius is an evidence-first harness for agent-assisted research. It gives AI
  coding agents a lifecycle and control plane for external research projects,
  together with checked-in skills that admit a durable result only after
  independent re-derivation, numerical convergence checks, source-grounded
  citation verification, and cross-model adversarial review.
